# PanelForge environment variables
#
# Phase 1 (current) runs entirely in the browser with no backend and no keys.
# Nothing here is required to run `npm run dev`.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CLIENT-SIDE (bundled into the browser build -- NEVER put secrets here)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is embedded in the shipped JavaScript and is public.

# Supabase project URL and anon key (Phase 9). The anon key is safe to expose
# only because Row Level Security restricts what it can read. Not used yet.
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key

# Base URL of the AI proxy server (Phase 8). Leave unset to stay in mock mode.
# VITE_AI_PROXY_URL=http://localhost:8787

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SERVER-SIDE ONLY (never prefixed VITE_, never imported by src/)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These live only in the AI proxy server's environment (Phase 8+).

# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=...
